- Okay?

240
00:19:22,673 --> 00:19:26,502
- Okay.
- Good girl.

241
00:19:29,392 --> 00:19:32,271
Sam, call the motor pool.

242
00:19:32,271 --> 00:19:36,102
Don't let Carson go
before I talk to him, okay?

243
00:19:53,393 --> 00:19:57,233
Come on.

244
00:19:57,233 --> 00:20:00,113
Listen, I don't buy
