He's changed his mind.

279
00:26:10,692 --> 00:26:12,612
He's left the dentist.
Looks like he's heading home.

280
00:26:12,612 --> 00:26:16,451
Get a hold of Maddy.
This guy's nobody's fool.

281
00:26:16,451 --> 00:26:19,333
