What is it?</i>

284
00:26:23,173 --> 00:26:27,001
He's on his way back.

285
00:26:27,972 --> 00:26:31,812
He's on his way back.

286
00:26:31,812 --> 00:26:35,642
He's on his way back.

287
00:26:37,572 --> 00:26:41,402
Got 'em all.

288
00:26:47,174 --> 00:26:51,003
Get me some aspirin.

289
00:27:22,695 --> 00:27:26,534
- He's here!
