298
00:28:13,578 --> 00:28:16,458
<i>Well, congratulations.
You happen to live in one.</i>

299
00:28:16,458 --> 00:28:19,338
That's the reason
that you're here?

300
00:28:19,338 --> 00:28:21,258
<i>Yes. We're hoping to include
this home in our tour.</i>

301
00:28:21,258 --> 00:28:23,179
I don't think so.

302
00:28:23,179 --> 00:28:27,019
<i>I think you're here because
of a much bigger reason.</i>

303
00:28:27,019 --> 00:28:29,899
I think it's fate.

304
00:28:29,899 --> 00:28:31,818
Destiny.

305
00:28:31,818 --> 00:28:35,659
<i>Kismet. It's a...</i>

306
00:28:35,659 --> 00:28:39,488
It's a confluence of energies...

307
00:28:40,459 --> 00:28:44,288
<i>and powers far beyond those...</i>

308
00:28:45,258 --> 00:28:47,179
