310
00:28:50,058 --> 00:28:52,939
No! No, Mom!

311
00:28:52,939 --> 00:28:56,779
I'm not watching TV!
I... I'm practicing.

312
00:28:56,779 --> 00:29:00,610
I'm practicing!

313
