Amazing.
Usually one is sufficient.

314
00:29:24,621 --> 00:29:27,500
<i>[Maddy] His name is
Richard Harlan Drew.</i>

315
00:29:27,500 --> 00:29:31,341
Born March 28, 1954,
Altoona, Pennsylvania...

316
00:29:31,341 --> 00:29:33,262
