340
00:30:56,786 --> 00:30:59,666
Sexual repression.

341
00:30:59,666 --> 00:31:02,544
Yeah.

342
00:31:02,544 --> 00:31:06,375
<i>Yeah, you can see it in the eyes.</i>

343
00:31:08,306 --> 00:31:12,135
