355
00:33:42,874 --> 00:33:45,753
Flushing the toilet?
Why is he flushing the toilet?

356
00:33:45,753 --> 00:33:48,633
There's got to be a reason why
he's flushing the toilet, Carson.

357
00:33:48,633 --> 00:33:52,475
