375
00:35:08,319 --> 00:35:11,197
Me, who?

376
00:35:11,197 --> 00:35:15,028
<i>Richard, come on. It's me.</i>

377
00:35:18,877 --> 00:35:22,708
- Oh.
- Why did you avoid me at the
